          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ivorySilk">Sun &amp; Harvest</h3>\par
          <p class="text-sm text-ivorySilk/70 mt-2 leading-relaxed">\par
            Marked by <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Pongal</strong> and Makar Sankranti, thanking the Sun God for abundant winter crops with sweet rice and kite-filled skies.\par
          </p>\par
        </div>\par
\par
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-indigoCard to-indigoDeep border border-goldLeaf/20 hover:border-crimson/60 transition-all">\par
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-crimson/20 text-rose-300 mb-4">Spring \bullet  Mar \endash  Apr</span>\par
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ivorySilk">Blossoms &amp; Colors</h3>\par
          <p class="text-sm text-ivorySilk/70 mt-2 leading-relaxed">\par
            <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Holi</strong> heralds spring\rquote s arrival with clouds of gulal, folk songs, and renewal, alongside springtime crescent moon celebrations.\par
          </p>\par
        </div>\par
\par
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-indigoCard to-indigoDeep border border-goldLeaf/20 hover:border-peacock/60 transition-all">\par
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-teal-500/20 text-teal-300 mb-4">Monsoon \bullet  Aug \endash  Sep</span>\par
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ivorySilk">Emerald Abundance</h3>\par
          <p class="text-sm text-ivorySilk/70 mt-2 leading-relaxed">\par
            Lush rains usher in <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Onam</strong> flower carpets in Kerala and the rhythmic drums of <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Ganesh Chaturthi</strong> across Maharashtra.\par
          </p>\par
        </div>\par
\par
        <div class="p-6 rounded-3xl bg-gradient-to-b from-indigoCard to-indigoDeep border border-goldLeaf/20 hover:border-saffron/60 transition-all">\par
          <span class="inline-block px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-semibold bg-saffron/20 text-orange-300 mb-4">Autumn \bullet  Oct \endash  Nov</span>\par
          <h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-ivorySilk">Triumph &amp; Radiance</h3>\par
          <p class="text-sm text-ivorySilk/70 mt-2 leading-relaxed">\par
            The grand crescendo of <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Navratri</strong>, <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Durga Puja</strong>, and <strong class="text-goldLeaf">Diwali</strong> illuminates cities with artistry, dance, and millions of lamps.\par
          </p>\par
        </div>\par
      </div>\par
    </section>\par
